label: Fetch Dwelling Rating
description: >-
  Third SDA call. blue-ribbon's fetchDwellingRating (ssurgo.ts:78), which
  filters `ruledepth = 0` to get the top-level rating rather than the sub-rule
  reason rows that share the same mrulename.
effect: http
input: DwellingRatingQuery
output: DwellingRating
